"Air Force 1" new 8 models such as NBA collaborations and "Gore-Tex"-equipped models appeared at once (WWD JAPAN.com)
Since its launch in 1982, Nike has been gaining popularity as the brand's signature sneaker, and will release a new 8 models of "AIR FORCE 1" starting in October.
