That’s one of the main reasons why a super-individual YouTuber has become a
Ask the hired president (bizSPA!
9/27 (Fri) 8:47
A YouTuber who is now extremely popular, especially among young people.
It is not unusual for companies to use it for advertising their own products, but there is a company that has started a rare mechanism called "younger recruitment" that hires as a full-time employee.
Direct Marketing Mix Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as DmMiX), whose main business is corporate CRM (customer relationship management).
What does it mean to “adobit YouTube”?
We spoke with Yuki Kobayashi, the president of DmMiX, who also serves as a representative of a subsidiary and staff-first company where YouTubers were actually hired.
I want to support young people who work hard with YouTuber recruitment
How does “YouTuber adoption” work in the first place?
Yuki Kobayashi (hereinafter referred to as “Kobayashi”): The career of a YouTuber has become a longing for many young people.
Elementary school students are also in the top of the ranking of occupations they want to work in the future, and the number of young people aiming for will continue to increase in the future.
Until now, we have recruited and supported young people who are chasing their dreams, such as bandmen and comedians.
In the same way, hiring young people who are chasing their dream of becoming a YouTuber and supporting them is "YouTuber recruitment".
I have an image of a YouTuber posting videos independently, so why did you decide to hire them?
Kobayashi: While many young people yearn for the profession of YouTubers, there is a reality that most YouTubers can't make the profits they thought they would.
There are many creators who make and post videos while working part-time, as well as creators who are not recognized by their families as YouTubers.
In this initiative, we will provide an environment for salaries and content creation to creators who have been hired.
At first, we are thinking of supporting the demerits of the profession of YouTuber, which will inevitably become an unstable position, by supporting our activities.
