[Video] "Insulting and despicable play" and overseas ripples!
The actual moment of the "facial danger tackle" played by U.S. representative Quill
A warm battle has crossed the line.
It's the 29th minute of the second half, which we picked up 0-38.
Farrell, an English captain deep into the enemy camp, lost a bit of a balance when he caught an ally's pass.
It was Quill who went to tackle this.
